<title>USA: Interactive Flight to redeem warrants.</title>
<headline>Interactive Flight to redeem warrants.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Interactive Flight Technologies Inc said Friday that it is exercising its right to redeem its class Ba warrants on January 17, 1997 for $0.05 per warrant.</p>
<p>The company also said that it intends to effect a voluntary exercise offer to reduce the exercise price of the warrants of class A common stock to $7.50 per share for a period before the redemption date.</p>
</text>
